not endorsed by their authors. Changes made are listed below.

1. isaaccorley/geospatial-skills, skill "gdal"
   https://github.com/isaaccorley/geospatial-skills
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Adapted: the general approach (inspect first, write new output, validate)
   and several ogr2ogr / ogrinfo command patterns.

2. jaakla/openmapstack-skills, skill "open-map-stack"
   https://github.com/jaakla/openmapstack-skills
   MIT License.
   Copyright (c) its respective authors. See the upstream repository for the
   full license text.
   Adapted: default format and CRS guidance (GeoPackage/GeoParquet, no
   Shapefile output, metric work in projected CRS), the PMTiles/tippecanoe/
   MapLibre delivery pattern, coordinate-order guidance and the list of
   anti-patterns.

Changes and additions in this project (not from the sources above):
- A CAD-specific workflow: DWG to DXF, CRS and unit confirmation, DXF
  inspection with ezdxf, handling of closed polylines and CAD layers.
- scripts/render_dxf.py, a layer-aware DXF to PNG renderer.
- Notes on GDAL DXF driver behaviour observed in testing.
- Rewritten and condensed text; no upstream file is included verbatim.
